{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788809608207695001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"defectible-befuddling-sheldrake","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"93ed0ba509c10bca4b2371be5f582db6a63a2f349a5b357d0394929c2927f348","event_uuid":"63d4dbae-26c2-49f7-abd0-5bb3e95b5c82","position":{"commit_sha":"1f0123933608f7f1de95427237d1e6ddb71b5885","position":"1788807220524870893-63d4dbae-26c2-49f7-abd0-5bb3e95b5c82"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"d97fb73e2a1b0d16562b8a244340fa3cd642643fdb86c8b3d109cd12096de97e","event_uuid":"d75d639d-6e19-493a-8974-41ed6c630e82","position":{"commit_sha":"f4a7ddfb9d59006c838f668d1f9435ea38caf06a","position":"1788807674414173302-d75d639d-6e19-493a-8974-41ed6c630e82"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"4111b789aeda2ceaa01203ffb253eb05c6d9aa199a56e5c3569ab5bbfe7152cd","event_uuid":"abc1dd8e-2802-4933-adc4-531f2c7d2b3d","position":{"commit_sha":"37d3c942d40a48f48eb11ee517c3eb4495467f88","position":"1788807805907444726-abc1dd8e-2802-4933-adc4-531f2c7d2b3d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788807220524870893,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"abc1dd8e-2802-4933-adc4-531f2c7d2b3d","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"a757-f58a-34cc-4ad1"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n`pytest-split==0.11.0` is pinned (`pyproject.toml:274`) but `.test_durations` is git-ignored as \"never committed\" (`.gitignore:65-66`, task 9ad9); no duration profile exists for splitting the suite, nor for the AGENTS.md 20-25 minute `make verify` budget. This story runs last in the epic so the profile covers the final suite after S1-S4. Cites are on origin/main 083620b0.\n\n## Approach\n- Remove `.gitignore:65-66`.\n- Run once from the repo root: `pytest -m \"not integration and not external\" -n 4 --dist worksteal --store-durations --clean-durations -q -p no:cacheprovider`. pytest-split writes on the controller's `pytest_sessionfinish` from `terminalreporter.stats` (`pytest_split/plugin.py:188-227`), so the xdist workers' reports are included.\n- Commit `.test_durations` (sorted JSON, ~2 MB for ~19.2k nodes).\n- Add `\\.test_durations` to the `check-added-large-files` `exclude` at `.pre-commit-config.yaml:33`, making it `^(uv\\.lock|\\.test_durations)$` (the 500 KB default cap would reject the file).\n- Add `### Per-test durations (.test_durations)` under `docs/local-dev-env.md:462` \"Day-to-day gates\" (after `:528`): the command above, that the file is refreshed by a deliberate re-run only, and `pytest --splits N --group K` usage.\n\n## Scope\nIn scope: `.gitignore`, `.pre-commit-config.yaml`, `.test_durations` (new), `docs/local-dev-env.md`. Out of scope: any CI workflow change that consumes the profile (`--splits`/`--group` is not wired into CI here), `pyproject.toml`, the `Makefile`, and every test module.\n\n## Testing\n`python -c \"import json;d=json.load(open('.test_durations'));print(len(d))\"` equals the node count printed by `pytest --collect-only -q -m \"not integration and not external\" | tail -1`; `pre-commit run --all-files` green; `pytest --splits 4 --group 1 --collect-only -q` collects a quarter of the suite; `python scripts/check_docs_index.py --check` green; the key count, the collect count and the group-1 count are recorded on this ticket.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `.test_durations` is tracked (`git ls-files .test_durations` prints it) and its key count equals the default-selection node count (the two commands above, recorded on this ticket).\n- [ ] `pre-commit run --all-files` accepts the file (`check-added-large-files` passes with the extended `exclude`).\n- [ ] The `### Per-test durations (.test_durations)` section exists in `docs/local-dev-env.md` and `python scripts/check_docs_index.py --check` passes.\n- [ ] `pytest --splits 4 --group 1 --collect-only -q` collects a quarter of the suite (count recorded on this ticket).\n- [ ] `make verify` green.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":".gitignore","reason":"un-ignore"},{"path":".pre-commit-config.yaml","reason":"large-file exclude"},{"path":".test_durations","reason":"new"},{"path":"docs/local-dev-env.md","reason":"note"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","a757-f58a-34cc-4ad1"],["parent","f400-65b3-1899-4af9"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"f400-65b3-1899-4af9","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["complexity-reduction","breaking-pass-4"],"ticket_id":"e873-b770-693c-4ff5","ticket_type":"story","title":"Record per-test durations once and commit .test_durations for pytest-split","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["63d4dbae-26c2-49f7-abd0-5bb3e95b5c82","d75d639d-6e19-493a-8974-41ed6c630e82","abc1dd8e-2802-4933-adc4-531f2c7d2b3d"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788809608207695001,"uuid":"77070bec-cca2-456c-87b5-866d193e2d19"}